The '''western ridge''' was a location in a canyon on the [[planet]] [[Ryloth]]. Early in the [[Imperial Era]], three members of the [[Free Ryloth Movement]], including [[Lenk]], observed [[Galactic Empire]] [[Imperial Military|forces]] arrest their comrades [[Gobi Glie]], [[Serin]], and [[Hera Syndulla]] for weapons [[Smuggler|smuggling]] from the ridge. The [[Elite Squad Trooper]] [[Crosshair]] noted their presence and informed [[Vice Admiral]] [[Edmon Rampart]], who told him to let the fighters report in so that he could lay a [[Rescue of Hera Syndulla (Ryloth)|trap]] for those who attempted to rescue them.<ref name="Devil's Deal" />

